Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: LibrePrint contributors <147175691+juujbyg@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), cups, cups-client
Suggests: hplip, printer-driver-hpcups, libsane-hpaio
Recommends: ipp-usb, avahi-daemon, avahi-utils, libnss-mdns, sane-utils, sane-airscan, cups-ipp-utils, python3-gi, gir1.2-adw-1, python3-cairo, fonts-liberation
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/@OWNER@/libreprint
Description: Set up any printer or scanner with one command
 LibrePrint detects printers and multifunction devices of any make (USB or
 network), sets them up driverless with IPP Everywhere, creates the CUPS queue,
 configures scanning (eSCL) and diagnoses common problems with
 "libreprint doctor". Older HP models are set up with HPLIP, and with HP's
 plugin when needed. It includes an app to print, scan, check ink levels and
 cancel jobs.
 .
 It builds on CUPS, IPP Everywhere, ipp-usb, HPLIP and SANE. It is not a new
 driver and is not affiliated with any printer manufacturer.
